flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4808478Z ^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4809342Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4810049Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4810354Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4810614Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4811897Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4812313Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4812584Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4813108Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4813348Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4813838Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4814516Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4815128Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4815602Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4815851Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4816126Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4816482Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4816759Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4817288Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4817479Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4817639Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4817867Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4818438Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4819156Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
