flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4821069Z I will:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4821807Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4822259Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4822983Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4823674Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4824350Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4825034Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4825561Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4826234Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
