flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4839200Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4840528Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4850729Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:10:05.4852114Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
